lopment, but the dinosaurs in the base escaped, and the base has been cut off from the mainland. Much of the base has been flooded with seawater. Jack Allen is part of an expedition sent out to investigate the Sierra disaster. But when their boat gets attacked by a Megalodon, the crew becomes shipwrecked on the shores of Sierra and must find a way to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of this team, you will delve into the dark secrets of the facility and uncover the truth behind the Dino outbreak. With a gripping narrative and heart-pumping action, <i>Fossilfuel 2</i> will keep you on the edge of your seat from start to finish. The game has a heavy focus on underwater horror and has a massive cast of dinosaurs including Utahraptor and Spinosaurus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nonlinear Replay Value:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide range of weapons and challenging AI, each encounter with the Dinosaurs will be unique. In <i>Fossilfuel 2</i>, no two playthroughs are the same. The game features <strong>multiple endings</strong> and <strong>player choices</strong> that change the course of the game. And with 12 hours of intense horror action, you will want to come back and play again and again to experience all the thrills this game has to offer. Get ready for a pulse-pounding adventure and uncover the truth at the Sierra Research Facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Garrys mod-like sandbox can be unlocked for players to brandish their creativity. Spawn NPCs and watch them fight, or make a house with the block spawner, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST TODAY AND DON'T MISS OUT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are encouraged to join the discord or leave comments in the community forum. Your feedback will be taken into consideration!</p>",
    "short_description": "Turn up the volume, turn off the lights, and get ready for the definitive Jurassic survival horror experience. Pump your shotgun and put those dinos back where they belong... in the ground!",
